examples.question_text:
The function shown has domain $[1,4]$ and range $[2,8]$. State the domain and range of its inverse.
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[x=10mm,y=5mm,every node/.style={text=black,font=\fontsize{10}{12}\selectfont}]
\definecolor{curveBlue}{HTML}{268CFF}
\draw[black,->] (0,0)--(5,0) node[right] {$x$};
\draw[black,->] (0,0)--(0,9) node[above] {$y$};
\draw[curveBlue,thick] (1,2)--(4,8);
\fill[black] (1,2) circle (1.5pt);
\fill[black] (4,8) circle (1.5pt);
\path (1,2) node[right] {$(1,2)$};
\path (4,8) node[left] {$(4,8)$};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]
